      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "title_card",
          "text": "A STATEMENT OF APPRECIATION"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "{p}Klaus, the cutest bulldog\nof all London, and I were\nseparated when we walked\nby Kensington High Street.\nI looked for him in many places,\nbut he was nowhere to find.\nWhen we got home, a handsome\nborder collie showed up at our door. In this good gentleman's mouth there was Klaus' collar, and our Klaus was standing next to him.\nIt would have made us very happy if this clever black-and-white border collie stayed longer with us. Sadly, he left our house quietly when we went to check Klaus.\nWe hope to find this dog and his owner, and send them 10 extra large boxes of \"Chewing Fun\" cookies as a thank-you.\n\nPlease let us know if you know them. Thank you!{img}"
        }
      ],
      "link_source": "supplement_episode_id"
    }
  ],
  "segments": [
    {
      "script_id": "200105",
      "internal_title": "【1.1】雷米特杯-3",
      "items": [
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "A black-and-white shepherd dog lies carefree on the unkempt lawn. He is perfectly covered by the weeds and wild flowers."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "Leisure is a treasure for Carnaby Street."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Achoo!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "But it never lasts long."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "???",
          "text": "Woof woof!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Hmm ... Woof woof?!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "Hearing Wendy's excited barking, lots of puppies start to gather. They run out of stores, leave fire hydrants, appear on the other side of the road, and rush to the place where Pickles is hiding."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Wendy",
          "text": "Woof woof!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof woof? Woof woof?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Wendy",
          "text": "Woof?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof woof …"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "Pickles sighs."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Nelson",
          "text": "Woof woof woof!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof woof woof?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Alice",
          "text": "Huumm."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Wendy",
          "text": "Woof woof!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "Pickles sighs again."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof woof woof woof …"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof, woof, woof ...?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "The other puppies are listening to Pickles with full attention."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Wendy",
          "text": "Woof, woooooof?!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof , woof woof?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Wendy",
          "text": "Woof ... Woof ... Woo?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof, woof woof, woof, woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Wendy",
          "text": "Woof woof!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof, woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "This time, Pickles doesn't sigh."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "He walks to the other side of the street alone, with his shadow pulled long by the sun."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Alice",
          "text": "Woof?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "Pickles avoids the crowd and eventually finds a quiet place to rest."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof woof woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "Pickles stares at the sky."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "It's still March, but why is there an apple on the cherry tree?!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "Hmm. The front door of Ace Cafe faces the North Circular Road. It is around 4.803 miles from the destination."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "Captain Regulus drives at 65 miles an hour. Given the rules of the racing, she will arrive earlier."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof ... woof?!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof woof …"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "Hmm? There is a lovely puppy."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "Mr. APPLe slowly falls down."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "Hello, Mr. Puppy."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof, woof woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof woof woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof woof woof woof woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "You look a bit nervous, Mr. Puppy. Are you hungry?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "Perhaps it is not a good time to fall."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof woof woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "Please don't show me your tongue at random. Makes this APPLe feel stressed out."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "Captain, help."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof woof woof?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "Excitement can be read in Pickles's eyes."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "Your eyes seemed to light up when I mentioned my captain."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "If Captain Regulus finishes the racing trouble-free, I might introduce you to her. But now, let's stay away from each other, puppy."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "Oh? It seems you are quite interested in \"Captain Regulus.\""
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "Wandering across high seas, she is a great pirate who never gets caught by all the Orwellian and the conservatives."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "Is my explanation precise enough? Hope my wording meets Captain's requirement."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof, woof woof?!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "I think you will like her."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof, woof woof?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "Most of the time, we are wandering in London. Captain is fond of anything novel and funny."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof ... Woof woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof woof woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "The sounds of a roaring engine, a collision, and a girl's screaming come from the street nearby."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "Oh, I am sorry, little puppy. I have to go. Captain Regulus seems to be in trouble."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "I really enjoyed our conversation. Hope I can fully understand what you say next time."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "Or, maybe I can invent a tool to help us communicate."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "See you, puppy. Bark, bark!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "title_card",
          "text": "TO BE CONTINUED ..."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "fallback_fields": []
}